; D 4120 BD 03 9A       CALL POSXY
; D 4123 CA 20          SEROUTI 20             ' '
; D 4125 43 03          DECX R3                and move it up a line
; D 4127 8C 03          TESTXZ R3              Off the top of the screen?
; D 4129 A0 01 3F       IFTRUEI NOSHOT         Then it is spent
; D 412C BD 03 2D       CALL HITTEST           Did it strike a ship?
