; D 413A BD 03 9A       CALL POSXY
; D 413D CA 7C          SEROUTI 7C             '|'
; D 413F 11 0B 09 74    LOADXI R11 0974        Is a bomb already falling?
; D 4143 33 0B          COPYMXA 0B
; D 4145 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 4148 A0 01 A5       IFTRUEI TRYDROP        No - see whether one starts now
