; D 41F1 86 0C 00 00    TESTXI R12 0000        Was it in the top row?
; D 41F5 A0 01 FC       IFTRUEI BOMBROW0
; D 41F8 52 0B 00 02    ADDXI R11 0002         Bottom row - two lines lower
