; D 4211 86 06 00 00    TESTXI R6 0000         Marching right?
; D 4215 A1 02 2B       IFFALSEI MLEFT
; D 4218 42 04          INCX R4
; D 421A 86 04 00 2F    TESTXI R4 002F         Reached the right-hand limit? (column 47)
