; D 4221 11 06 00 01    LOADXI R6 0001         Turn around
; D 4225 BD 02 A9       CALL DROP              and drop a line
; D 4228 B0 02 3B       GAL MARCHED
; D 422B 43 04          DECX R4
; D 422D 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002         Reached the left-hand limit?
; D 4231 A1 02 3B       IFFALSEI MARCHED
; D 4234 11 06 00 00    LOADXI R6 0000         Turn around
; D 4238 BD 02 A9       CALL DROP              and drop a line
