; D 4240 A0 02 4F       IFTRUEI WIN
; D 4243 86 05 00 15    TESTXI R5 0015         Has the formation reached line 21?
; D 4247 A0 02 56       IFTRUEI LOSE
; D 424A C0 02          DLYI 02                Pace the game
; D 424C B0 00 6F       GAL LOOP
; D 424F 11 0C 09 A0    LOADXI R12 09A0        The message goes in R12 - R14 is POSXY's column
